ub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104255.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-17T15:59:13Z"},"body":"https://sourceforge.net/projects/libpng/files/libpng16/1.6.47/\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 1.6.45 to version 1.6.46**:\r\n\r\n- Added support for the mDCV and cLLI chunks.\r\n- Fixed a build issue affecting C89 compilers. This was a regression introduced in libpng-1.6.45.\r\n- Added makefile.c89, specifically for testing C89 compilers.\r\n- Cleaned up contrib/pngminus: corrected an old typo, removed an old workaround, and updated the CMake file.\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 1.6.46 to version 1.6.47**:\r\n\r\n- Modified the behaviour of colorspace chunks in order to adhere to the new precedence rules formulated in the latest draft of the PNG Specification.\r\n- Fixed a latent bug in `png_write_iCCP`. This would have been a read-beyond-end-of-malloc vulnerability, introduced early in the libpng-1.6.0 development, yet (fortunately!) it was inaccessible before the above-mentioned modification of the colorspace precedence rules, due to pre-existing colorspace checks.\r\n\r\n_Listed contributors have been removed to make reading of the above list(s) easier._\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git